Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:06.92,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,880,4760,5600)\pos(640,464)}Episode 2 \N\N\N\N\N\NThe Crisis of Ten Attendants
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:31.58,Default,Cao Jie,0,0,0,,Ginseng soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.09,0:00:53.84,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,As I see it, the emperor will only last two more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.22,0:00:58.12,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:01:02.42,Default,Cheng Kuang,0,0,0,,the emperor favors Liu Xie, so he'd want for him to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:04.96,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,But what about Liu Bian?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:10.08,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,Do you think Empress He and \Nher brother He Jin will just leave it at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:08.52,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(285.714,405.714)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2400,2720)}Duàn Guī
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.02,0:01:16.34,Default,Cheng Kuang,0,0,0,,Our current plan is to eliminate He Jin. \NWhen he dies, Empress He-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.34,0:01:18.89,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,How could she be where she is without us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:21.87,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,Who is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:28.69,Default,Snitch,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zhang Rang and others were plotting.\NTell the Empress Dowager now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:29.84,Default,Snitch,0,0,0,,Go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.44,0:01:32.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(338.286,358.857)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1540,1880)}Empress Dowager Dǒng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.35,0:01:35.16,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,O divine spirits, please bless His Majesty for an expedient recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.04,0:01:40.33,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,I am willing to trade my remaining years \Nfor my imperial son to have a few more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.03,0:01:48.23,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,O divine spirits, please bless His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.72,0:01:48.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,480)\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2020,2320)}Liú Xié
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:52.14,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Grandmother, no... Empress Dowager, do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.14,0:01:54.08,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,I will definitely be a good emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:56.16,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,O divine spirits, please bless His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:03.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(977.333,473.333)\fade(255,0,255,0,500,1780,2120)}Empress Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:09.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(941.333,461.333)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2050,2440)}Liú Biàn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-My respects, Empress Dowager Dong.\N- My respects, Empress He.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.02,0:02:26.68,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,Rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.66,0:02:29.40,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:41.69,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,Grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:07.96,Default,Ladies,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.47,0:03:13.58,Default,Ladies,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.71,0:03:31.87,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,Send several men to monitor Empress He.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:30.16,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(306.667,381.333)\fade(255,0,255,0,520,2460,2920)}Jiàn Shuò
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:35.23,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,If she takes action, report back to me immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.23,0:03:37.10,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,We must act before them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:38.12,Default,Jian Shuo,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:45.26,Default,Jian Shuo,0,0,0,,Has the Grand General reached the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.68,Default,Eunuch,0,0,0,,Probably still on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:48.85,Default,Jian Shuo,0,0,0,,If anyone leaks information, kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.85,0:03:49.51,Default,Eunuch,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.95,0:04:15.94,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,Grand General.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.43,0:04:17.83,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,This way please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:22.42,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,Grand General, don't enter the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.42,0:04:24.81,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,His Majesty summoned me. How could I not go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:26.44,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,His Majesty has passed away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.67,0:04:29.60,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,The Ten Attendants are hiding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:31.60,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,They must be trying to assassinate you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.54,0:04:36.46,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:42.24,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:45.76,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(322.667,428)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1980,2520)}Zhāng Ràng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:45.28,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Who told on us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.82,0:04:52.12,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,It was that guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:59.30,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Jian Shuo, make sure to step up security!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:03.87,Default,Jian Shuo,0,0,0,,I will see to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:15.35,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,He Jin still wants to enter the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:17.02,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:20.68,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,It is to force Liu Bian onto the imperial throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.46,0:05:26.62,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,This is an urgent matter. \NWe must all speak as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:33.11,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,That eunuch cabal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.11,0:05:35.63,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,I will exterminate them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:38.34,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Grand General, please calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:40.76,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(326.667,456)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1950,2600)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.46,0:05:42.50,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The eunuchs' power has been growing since the reigns of Emperors Chong and Zhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:44.48,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,They have wide sway over the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.48,0:05:49.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Their power did not grow overnight, nor can they be cut down overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:52.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(317.333,452)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1500,2080)}Hé Jìn\NStyled: Suìgāo
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:52.68,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,If this plan leaks, we will be the ones eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.99,0:05:55.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Please, Grand General, reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:05:58.42,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,You're but a subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:06:00.50,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,What do you know of court politics?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.27,0:06:10.87,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,The late emperor favored Jian Shuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.29,0:06:15.67,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Jian Shuo and Empress Dowager \NDong have a close relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:21.00,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Only by blaming Jian Shuo can we still save our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:26.26,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,Yes! Blame it all on Jian Shuo! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:31.72,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Second, we must hurry over to \NEmpress He and beg for our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:35.67,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Only she has the power to save us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:39.92,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Grand General, you are to hurry over to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:41.04,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Return ahead of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:41.79,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.79,0:06:44.98,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Grand General, Jian Shuo controls the palace guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:47.08,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I worry that they have set an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.49,0:06:52.37,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord8}We should first install the rightful emperor, then wipe out any traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:56.44,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Mengde, your words quite suit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:06:59.48,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Who would venture to help me eliminate them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:01.80,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Give me 5,000 elite troops to barge in,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:05.68,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}coronate the emperor, kill the eunuchs and restore peace to the realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:08.60,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,With Benchu helping me, I can rest assured!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.90,0:07:09.69,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.69,0:07:12.30,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Summon all the ministers to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:11.04,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:13.70,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:18.48,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:26.51,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir, we have cleared any ambushes outside the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.51,0:08:28.72,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We dare not venture further into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.73,0:08:31.44,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Why are we not using this time to slay the eunuchs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:34.33,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We can cleanse the court to restore the realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.33,0:08:37.50,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Grand General, I believe that our current plan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:40.93,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord8}should be enthroning a new lord before handling the eunuchs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:48.18,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What Mengde said is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.18,0:08:50.81,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The nation can't go on without it's sovereign!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:52.86,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We should crown the new emperor now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:06.15,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,I ask you, Crown Prince, to ascend the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:57.39,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,I, He Jin, congratulate you on your ascension!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.68,0:10:00.14,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Long live!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.64,0:10:02.42,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Long live!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:05.40,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Long live!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:30.90,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Elder brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:34.70,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,you can't trust those high officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:39.33,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,I know what goes on inside the palace more than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:46.12,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,The plot to murder you was\Norchestrated by Jian Shuo and him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:48.24,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Zhang Rang and the others were not involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.24,0:10:49.99,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.85,0:10:53.48,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Why you are favoring Zhang Rang and his ilk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:04.11,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Grand General.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.69,0:11:09.63,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Think about this carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:12.93,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,We come from a poor background.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:14.94,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,If it were not for the eunuchs,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:17.56,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,would we have our current positions and ranks,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:19.23,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,enjoying wealth and prestige?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.23,0:11:20.89,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager, you are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:23.10,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.97,0:11:26.29,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Where is Jian Shuo now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.09,0:11:33.82,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,You may all come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.88,0:11:46.13,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,Grand General, spare our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:52.02,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Sir, it was Jian Shuo who worked with Empress Dowager Dong in a plot to murder you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.35,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,We were not involved whatsoever!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.35,0:11:57.41,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,The wicked Jian Shuo has already been slain by us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:12:00.08,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,See, his head is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:05.12,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Grand General, for the sake of \Nour past alliance, please spare us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.53,0:12:10.16,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,From now on, we will await your orders before acting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:13.49,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,We swear our loyalty! We would never betray you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:21.21,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Jian Shuo has already been punished for his crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.80,0:12:25.50,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Why should you believe the words of others?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:28.57,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,They are truly innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.19,0:12:33.92,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,For the sake of the Empress Dowager,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:35.84,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,you lot will be spared this once!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.33,0:12:38.63,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,But hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.77,0:12:41.70,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,There will not be a next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:46.22,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,If you plot against me again,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:50.10,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,do not blame me when I show no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:57.64,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,Thank you, Grand General! We would not dare, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:27.48,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Jian Shuo has been slain for plotting to murder me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:32.31,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Grand General, Zhang Rang merely shifted the blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:36.38,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Do you really want to let \Nthe Ten Attendants get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:45.04,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,I will make sure the entire Jian clan is to be exterminated to the last!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:47.30,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,There will be no survivors!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:56.54,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,As for the rest of the eunuchs...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:13:59.38,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,There is no need for further cruelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:03.12,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,If we don't remove the eunuchs now, \Nthere will be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:06.09,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,My decision is final! This talk is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.69,0:14:10.95,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.19,0:14:19.07,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager Emerita, do not hurt your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:25.94,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,You were all servants of the late emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.94,0:14:28.94,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,and he favored and supported all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:31.61,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,Why are you all mute now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.28,0:14:38.56,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager Emerita, the \Nlate emperor's bones are not cold yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.56,0:14:41.92,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Would they dare show impudence to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:45.12,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Right now, you are the Empress Dowager Emerita.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.11,0:14:50.24,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,That Empress Dowager He, \Ndespite her son being emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:53.34,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,must still show respect to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:56.48,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,And now, regardless of the late emperor's passing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.48,0:14:59.30,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,if you wished to say something,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.86,0:15:04.17,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,those civil and military officers, \Nincluding He Jin and Empress He,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:07.17,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,who among them would dare to disobey you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:08.44,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.75,0:15:13.32,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,You have just become Empress Dowager Emerita.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.83,0:15:21.36,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,When that He Jin installed Liu Bian as emperor, he was only one step ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:25.08,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager Emerita,\N you are not allowing each do their own work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.39,0:15:28.00,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,Each do their own work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:32.24,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Empress He has Prince Bian,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.24,0:15:35.36,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but do you not also have Prince Xie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.36,0:15:37.85,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Empress He has her elder brother He Jin,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.85,0:15:42.92,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but do you not also have relatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.99,0:15:49.74,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In my opinion, we should act sooner rather than later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:54.03,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Tomorrow morning, you can go before the court officials,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:56.35,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and ennoble Prince Xie as the Prince of Chenliu
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:15:59.78,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,{\bord8)}and appoint your nephew, \NDong Chong, as General of Fast Cavalry
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.78,0:16:03.38,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You would allow for an equal balance of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:08.80,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.39,0:16:13.37,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}From now on, I will govern from behind the curtain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.39,0:16:17.18,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Women were not allowed to attend court, but empresses would circumvent this by hearing court discussions from behind a curtain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.56,0:16:33.64,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:39.90,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,What is the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:43.81,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,This morning, when you were not present,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.81,0:16:47.44,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager Dong suddenly \Nattended court to listen to the proceedings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:51.16,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,It's been decreed to ennoble Liu Xie as Prince of Chenliu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:54.12,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,appoint Dong Chong as General of Fast Cavalry,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:57.76,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,and give the Ten Attendants control over state matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:16:59.96,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Is this true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.72,0:17:07.41,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,If this is not the work of the Ten Attendants,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.68,0:17:12.19,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,then it is the Empress \NDowager Emerita causing trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:15.12,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Let me go to the palace and investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:32.99,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Elder brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:38.12,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,in my opinion, the Ten Attendants are not related to this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:40.93,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,I have heard nothing of the sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.82,0:17:44.61,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Think about it, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:47.74,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,With my Liu Bian succeeding the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.74,0:17:51.12,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,how could the Empress \NDowager Emerita not be angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:55.48,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,You, the Grand General, control all military forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.48,0:17:57.39,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,How can she not be jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.81,0:18:03.18,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,If I could guess her intentions,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:06.30,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,she wants nothing more than to oppose our clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:08.97,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.67,0:18:13.00,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,That day, Zhang Rang and the\N eunuchs swore allegiance to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:15.56,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Being spared, they would not dare oppose me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.56,0:18:18.27,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,The Empress Dowager Emerita is weak and isolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.27,0:18:21.95,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,She naturally wants the aid of the Ten Attendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:25.02,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:29.68,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,we need to find an opportunity \Nto tell her to partake less in politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:38.23,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:45.94,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,We are family, so talk frankly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.68,0:18:47.92,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,No need to be so formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.27,0:18:55.44,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Imperial Mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.01,0:18:58.84,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,you and I are women.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:02.24,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Interfering in politics is improper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.79,0:19:09.22,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,In the past, when Empress Lü held power, she interfered in politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:13.37,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Empress Lü dominated early Han governance for \Nfifteen years through brutality and puppet emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:13.37,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,In the end, over a thousand of her kin \Nwas executed, her clan destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.04,0:19:18.06,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,We should only remain peacefully in the harem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.06,0:19:22.33,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Let the veteran consuls discuss government affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:25.31,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,This is what is best for the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:29.32,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,I sincerely hope you will heed your daughter-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.24,0:19:33.27,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,You dare come to lecture me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.02,0:19:38.18,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,If I never advocated for you, \Nhow could you be where you are today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.18,0:19:41.44,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,Your son is the Emperor now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:43.86,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,but could you have done it without backing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.38,0:19:45.83,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,I would not dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:48.49,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,I only wanted to give a reminder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.78,0:19:51.01,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,A reminder?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:55.27,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,I am quite aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:19:58.04,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,First, you were jealous of Beauty Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:20:00.19,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Beauty Wang, the mother of Liu Xie, was a favored concubine of Emperor Ling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:00.19,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,so you had her poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:04.22,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,Now, do you wish to kill me as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:10.76,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,Keep spouting nonsense and I will have \NDong Chong kill you and your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.88,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,I tried to advise you nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:19.44,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Imperial Mother, why are you so unreasonable?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:20.64,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:26.15,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,You dare to speak about being unreasonable?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:30.57,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,Absurd! How absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.91,0:20:31.69,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.38,0:20:46.53,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Imperial Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.67,0:20:50.50,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,you should not talk like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.07,0:20:55.22,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,I came from a poor background, that is not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.89,0:20:58.81,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Yet, Imperial Mother, you used to be a concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.81,0:21:01.65,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,If your son did not succeed Emperor Huan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.65,0:21:03.80,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,how could you be the national mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.45,0:21:11.94,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Given our current roles, it is for the best to not mention our past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.94,0:21:13.45,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,What about being a concubine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.45,0:21:17.12,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,This concubine was a hundred times better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:24.87,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Maybe then, but not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.20,0:21:28.33,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,What is so different between then and now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.68,0:21:31.68,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,Is it that you want to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.17,0:21:35.34,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,I would not dare to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:38.12,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,I would only dare kill pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:38.12,Note (Potential style?),Empress He,0,0,0,,Note: The He clan was originally a family of butchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:38.91,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.68,0:21:44.43,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,Outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.29,0:21:46.20,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,I would not dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:49.03,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,How could a junior slight their elders?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.03,0:21:50.92,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be a major offense?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:53.66,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,The Emperor should be the one to punish me, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.65,0:21:57.71,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,You cannot use the Emperor to scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:21:59.38,Default,Empress Dowager Dong,0,0,0,,I am not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.05,0:22:01.98,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.51,0:22:05.24,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Then what would make you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:22.60,Default,Demoting Eunuch,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Empress Dowager Emerita Dong, \Nbeing a concubine of a marquis in origin,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.60,0:22:25.37,Default,Demoting Eunuch,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}is unfit to stay any longer in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.37,0:22:27.66,Default,Demoting Eunuch,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With the death of the late emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.66,0:22:30.34,Default,Demoting Eunuch,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}there is even less reason for her to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.34,0:22:33.87,Default,Demoting Eunuch,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Therefore, she should return to her hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.87,0:22:37.24,Default,Demoting Eunuch,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We hereby decree that she is to leave for Hejian now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.00,0:23:19.19,Default,Hejian Eunuch,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager Emerita...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.19,0:23:21.51,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The Emerita is not used to your crude meals!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.51,0:23:22.88,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Get rid of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.88,0:23:24.00,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Bring it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.88,0:23:42.76,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,This imperial wine is a gift from \Nthe Grand General to honor you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.76,0:23:47.00,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Honor me by drinking it, Empress \NDowager Emerita, then I'll report back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.28,0:24:07.39,Default,Hejian Eunuch,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager Emerita! The wine is poisoned! \NEmpress Dowager Emerita!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.93,0:24:14.52,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Please drink the wine, Empress Dowager Emerita.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.12,0:26:05.16,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,The Empress Dowager Emerita \Nhas been poisoned by He Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.32,0:26:08.52,Default,Feng Xu,0,0,0,,He Jin, that pig butcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.84,0:26:10.80,Default,Feng Xu,0,0,0,,How dare he murder the state mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:14.69,Default,Feng Xu,0,0,0,,Arrogant traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:20.36,Default,Cao Jie,0,0,0,,If we never advocated for him, \Nhow could he be where he is today?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.06,0:26:23.68,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,The mountains that backed us have collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.68,0:26:26.19,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,With our backers killed, what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.90,0:26:31.68,Default,Zhao Zhong,0,0,0,,We can only see where the wind blows before steering the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.24,0:26:36.11,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we will have to rely on He Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.11,0:26:36.73,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,Either way-
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.73,0:26:37.60,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.58,0:26:40.95,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Although He Jin is witless and indecisive,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.95,0:26:43.87,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,who among his backing officials does not hate us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.06,0:26:47.32,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Without their encouragement,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.32,0:26:50.83,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,would He Jin have enthroned \Na new lord during the late one's funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.01,0:26:54.81,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,And now, he has poisoned the Empress Dowager Emerita.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.68,0:26:59.86,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,If we do not take action now,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.86,0:27:01.73,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,we will be endangered!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.48,0:27:02.99,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.99,0:27:08.80,Default,Zhao Zhong,0,0,0,,Only by removing He Jin \Ncan we suppress any dissent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.29,0:27:16.42,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,All our power lies inside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.50,0:27:21.72,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,We must keep control over\N the Emperor or the Empress Dowager.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.16,0:27:23.35,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Afterwards...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.08,0:27:26.68,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,we can do as we please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.71,0:27:29.85,Default,Zhao Zhong,0,0,0,,Wherever the Empress Dowager is,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.85,0:27:33.71,Default,Zhao Zhong,0,0,0,,we must attend to her carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.49,0:27:37.87,Default,Zhao Zhong,0,0,0,,As long as we can handle the three royals,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.87,0:27:41.64,Default,Zhao Zhong,0,0,0,,eliminating He Jin will be easy as turning our hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.40,0:27:53.32,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How could I not want to kill the eunuchs?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.10,0:27:58.62,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}But the Empress Dowager said,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.62,0:28:02.94,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"The eunuch control over the palace was instituted by the previous emperor."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.94,0:28:05.04,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"We cannot abolish them arbitrarily."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.76,0:28:09.23,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\}She also said, "the late emperor has only recently passed on."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.23,0:28:14.04,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"To kill veteran servants is to bring insult to the shrine of the forefathers."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.57,0:28:18.15,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What can I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.80,0:28:21.23,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Indecision will cause trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.45,0:28:27.66,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Grand General,the officers under my tent are all heroic and mighty,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.66,0:28:29.27,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}they are yours to command.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.12,0:28:33.22,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Zhang Rang and Duan Gui are spreading rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.22,0:28:36.51,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How can we not use this chance to kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.51,0:28:38.08,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Do not waste this opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.94,0:28:41.47,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The Empress Dowager will never go along with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.47,0:28:43.22,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What then?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.68,0:28:48.46,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Grand General, call frontier troops into the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.46,0:28:50.34,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You can then execute the eunuchs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.34,0:28:53.06,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}By then, the Empress Dowager cannot refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.11,0:28:55.47,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,An excellent plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.23,0:28:57.44,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,An excellent plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.73,0:28:59.34,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Call for Registrar Chen Lin!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.34,0:29:01.34,Default,Chen Lin Caller,0,0,0,,Call for Registrar Chen Lin!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.86,0:29:11.33,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,My servants visited my mother and my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.33,0:29:15.04,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Are you still afraid I cannot keep your old lives safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.30,0:29:17.41,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager, you humor us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.41,0:29:20.75,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Who could match a stalwart protector like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.89,0:29:22.09,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,True! True!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.82,0:29:31.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I, Cao Cao, greet you, Grand General.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.06,0:29:43.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir, purging the eunuchs is like turning your hand, what is there to discuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.12,0:29:47.52,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}A warden is equal to the task, why summon a frontier army?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.95,0:29:57.93,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}One warden is enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.93,0:29:59.52,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}One warden is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.52,0:30:03.54,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The ringleaders are the issue! Why eliminate the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.54,0:30:06.86,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}To kill everyone is to reveal our plot! We would fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.64,0:30:15.67,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.12,0:30:18.84,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Mengde is of eunuch descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.12,0:30:22.05,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Cao Cao's father, Cao Song, was the adopted son of the eunuch Cao Jie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.13,0:30:22.05,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Of course he is soft on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.61,0:30:23.15,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You-!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.24,0:30:32.76,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(331.429,462.857)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2520,2520)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.20,0:30:35.83,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The one who ruins the nation, be none other than Hé Jìn!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.60,0:30:40.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(325.333,452)\fade(255,0,255,0,540,2200,2600)}Dīng Yuán\NStyled: Jiànyáng
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.87,0:30:40.89,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,Dong Zhuo has petitioned\N that he will remove the eunuchs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.07,0:30:47.61,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,Who doesn't know of his relation with the Ten Attendants?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.87,0:30:49.82,Default,Zheng Tai,0,0,0,,When the Yellow Scarves rebelled,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.82,0:30:52.56,Default,Zheng Tai,0,0,0,,he was defeated and suffered heavy casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.10,0:30:55.91,Default,Zheng Tai,0,0,0,,Had the Ten Attendants not interceded,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.91,0:30:59.12,Default,Zheng Tai,0,0,0,,how could a failure like him replace Secretary Lu?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.50,0:31:05.81,Default,Minister,0,0,0,,Fortunately, Huangfu Song \Ntestified to your merits, Secretary Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.81,0:31:10.06,Default,Minister,0,0,0,,Otherwise, Zigan, how could you be here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.79,0:31:23.97,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.11,0:31:29.04,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Dong Zhuo is coming with 200,000 armored troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.34,0:31:32.74,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,We will purge the eunuchs as if turning our hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.34,0:31:37.24,Default,Zheng Tai,0,0,0,,Grand General, Dong Zhuo is alike a rabid wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.72,0:31:37.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(361.143,265.143)\fade(255,0,255,0,415,2150,2480)}Zhèng Tài
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.24,0:31:39.88,Default,Zheng Tai,0,0,0,,Let him in the capital, and he will eat the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.14,0:31:44.12,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,You are too suspicious! \NUnfit to council.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.02,0:31:49.04,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,Grand General, I know what sort of man Dong Zhuo is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.80,0:31:49.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(316.8,502.4)\fade(255,0,255,0,520,2750,3240)}Lú Zhí\NStyled: Zǐgān
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.04,0:31:51.65,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,He may seems kind\Nbut is cruel as can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.44,0:31:55.10,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,Once he is in the capital, he will bring calamity.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.51,0:31:59.24,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,Prevent his entry to the capital to avoid chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.69,0:32:01.73,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Yours are the words of pedants!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.40,0:32:04.73,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,No more discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.81,0:32:08.11,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,The order has been given.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.86,0:32:17.38,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.50,0:32:29.01,Default,Lu Zhi & Zheng Tai,0,0,0,,We can no longer bear this office.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.34,0:32:31.00,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.01,0:32:37.92,Thinking,He Jin,0,0,0,,Abandoning posts and fleeing...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.80,0:32:58.28,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(982.667,448)\fade(255,0,255,0,375,2150,2480)}Dǒng Zhuó\NStyled: Zhòngyǐng
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.88,0:33:05.32,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.32,0:33:08.60,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,The Grand General is sending \Nfrontier armies to the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.60,0:33:12.50,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,He plans to kill us! Save our lives,\N Empress Dowager, we beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.50,0:33:15.66,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,He plans to kill us! Save our lives,\N Empress Dowager, we beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.54,0:33:19.45,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.50,0:33:21.81,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,All of you, rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.83,0:33:33.71,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,What is the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.65,0:33:39.49,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,You can just go to the Grand General's manor and admit fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.15,0:33:43.63,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,I will go to intercede for you once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.95,0:33:48.05,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.67,0:33:53.05,Default,Duan Gui,0,0,0,,We servants wouldn't dare go to the Grand General's manor!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.05,0:33:54.80,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,We dare not...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.80,0:33:57.80,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,If we go over to his residence to admit our faults,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.80,0:33:59.97,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,we'll be crushed into dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.97,0:34:00.75,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.75,0:34:04.45,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager, we hope you \Nwill summon him into the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.45,0:34:09.61,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,We would make amends to him before you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.61,0:34:10.18,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.54,0:34:12.29,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.35,0:34:18.34,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.43,0:34:22.30,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,If the Grand General will not forgive us this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.30,0:34:25.91,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,we would rather die before you, Empress Dowager!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.91,0:34:29.13,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,We do not want to die outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.70,0:34:34.90,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager! Save us...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.90,0:34:35.81,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Alright, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.79,0:34:40.14,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,I shall do as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.87,0:34:44.72,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Summon the Grand General into the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.97,0:34:47.12,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,Thank you, Empress Dowager!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.70,0:34:53.70,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Pass the order!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.07,0:34:56.53,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Summon the Grand General into the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.16,0:35:03.12,Default,Chen Lin,0,0,0,,Grand General, do not enter the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.12,0:35:03.95,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.95,0:35:06.82,Default,Chen Lin,0,0,0,,The edict must be a trap set by\N Zhang Rang and Duan Gui!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.82,0:35:10.89,Default,Chen Lin,0,0,0,,General, do not go inside, lest you face trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.89,0:35:13.85,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Ridiculous! My own sister summoned me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.85,0:35:15.30,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,How can there be trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.30,0:35:18.45,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Our order for frontier troops must have leaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.45,0:35:19.67,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,We are exposed!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.67,0:35:21.02,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,We cannot enter the palace-!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.02,0:35:25.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Get all the eunuchs out of the palace\N before meeting the Empress Dowager!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.20,0:35:27.62,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Opinions of lesser men!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.98,0:35:29.81,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,I hold supreme power in the realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.81,0:35:32.40,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,What could the Ten Attendants dare do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.76,0:35:36.94,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,If you insist on going, we will escort you for your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.94,0:35:38.01,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.01,0:35:39.39,Default,He Jin,0,0,0,,No need for worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.60,0:35:51.72,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.86,0:35:59.67,Default,Eunuchs,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.17,0:36:23.90,Default,Cao Jie,0,0,0,,The Empress Dowager only wants the Grand General.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.90,0:36:26.67,Default,Cao Jie,0,0,0,,No one else may be allowed inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.64,0:36:41.34,Thinking,He Jin,0,0,0,,I hold supreme power in the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.34,0:36:44.86,Thinking,He Jin,0,0,0,,What could Zhang Rang, Duan Gui, \Nand the others even do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.33,0:37:00.97,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Grand General, please board your carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.83,0:37:04.29,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Grand General, please board your carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.28,0:37:12.48,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Grand General...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.66,0:37:19.64,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,The eunuchs murdered a dignitary!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.64,0:37:21.12,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Follow me into the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.12,0:37:22.69,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Exterminate the eunuchs!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.08,0:37:44.74,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager, this is an emergency! \NFollow us out of the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.74,0:37:47.12,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,No, I'm not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.63,0:37:48.44,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.87,0:37:50.74,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,No, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.80,0:37:52.91,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.40,0:37:56.85,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere! \NLet go of me! Someone, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.68,0:38:01.03,Default,Zhang Rang,0,0,0,,Quick, this way, this way! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.50,0:38:06.40,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.48,0:38:09.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.48,0:38:11.53,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.84,0:38:13.78,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.10,0:38:17.11,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.19,0:38:38.57,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Please, Empress Dowager.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.97,0:38:41.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,We await your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.28,0:38:46.33,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Liu Bian...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.14,0:38:49.00,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,Liu Bian!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.97,0:38:51.80,Default,Empress He,0,0,0,,My son!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.80,0:38:52.64,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.35,0:38:55.31,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.31,0:38:57.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Find the Emperor and the Prince of Chenliu!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.62,0:39:15.52,Default,Min Gong,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.14,0:39:17.03,Default,Min Gong,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.36,0:39:18.08,Default,Min Gong,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.40,0:39:21.16,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(352,378.667)}Mǐn Gòng
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.72,0:39:20.57,Default,Min Gong,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.42,0:39:33.28,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.82,0:39:35.08,Default,Liu Bian,0,0,0,,Please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.79,0:39:52.70,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Who comes?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.19,0:40:06.53,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I, the Marquis of Aoxiang, the Overseer of Xiliang, Dong Zhuo, have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.84,0:40:08.08,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(365.333,457.333)}Wáng Yǔn\NStyled: Zǐshī
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.31,0:40:10.68,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,You are Dong Zhuo?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.68,0:40:12.64,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,This minister of yours is Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.97,0:40:15.70,Default,Liu Bian,0,0,0,,When the Yellow Scarves rebelled,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.70,0:40:18.76,Default,Liu Bian,0,0,0,,you were defeated and suffered heavy casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.76,0:40:19.93,Default,Liu Bian,0,0,0,,Do you admit guilt?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.93,0:40:21.64,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I admit my guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.91,0:40:23.52,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,The court regime is still young,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.54,0:40:26.84,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,but you came to rescue us in time, rendering us a great service.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.60,0:40:27.56,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294.667,446.667)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1680,2000)}Lǐ Rú
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.84,0:40:30.67,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,You can redeem yourself by performing good deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.56,0:40:28.76,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(964,474.667)}Lǐ Sù
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.67,0:40:32.05,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.05,0:40:36.37,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,How dare this minister of yours \Nnot work hard to support the court?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.83,0:40:38.26,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Escort us to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.08,0:40:51.60,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Long live Your Majesty!

